<title>SPAIN: Spain Treasury reintroduces 6-month Treasury paper.</title>
<headline>Spain Treasury reintroduces 6-month Treasury paper.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish Treasury said on Friday that it would reintroduce the issue of six-month bills as a means of permanent financing to cover its needs.</p>
<p>The first issues will take place on September 25. The Treasury has made a calendar available on Reuter page  KSPQ.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
